    {
      "id": "5f1b5b8b-6f74-45a4-9102-86873546241e",
      "title": "Leia a frase e observe que a ação quase não acontece.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "2337c198-0a41-4b6f-a061-b99d2b4c5d3e",
          "textContent": "<p>Observe a mudança de sentido.</p><p><strong>Casi nunca ceno tarde.</strong></p><p>Em português: Quase nunca janto tarde.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/1399dd49abc04d2eb9fe3159149ae31e_casi-nunca-ceno-tarde.mp3?Expires=1794099447&Signature=ZCwXc~C2jNPMM0eDuUlGat5-oPxRXTIfUjQMgW-vw4qzvIkaXb9SfOl4G3vgS5Y8tLVXfwdlL6LdgIaur3h24uEcbi5dgXrYWjpHJOZmUYOVtqrlQvbYPOH1liVQCFaB0RrzH-BcHMsK~PtOZkR1m~YUw8aH-zV~Au2jrRdFndcHIj1820mRPCU9emTodQMjuZXhkFX8CBfvyzh91kr~FAVFM58zsp-776-NeIMRZxNBQI9sCaRibqegvcf6f2qTXn4l1AYhz9-2EcACDTZwOo0W-QgUscNOTl2bSmf4lI7uUgDdR92QrifbbzU3tfq~23lOjWydb81IuOj1LgPaOA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
