    {
      "id": "1ba18b5c-17ef-431b-be49-f57c1de10de1",
      "title": "Leia a frase e observe a ideia de frequência zero.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "4e2c5550-7912-42ac-850e-e278db69047e",
          "textContent": "<p>Observe a expressão mais forte.</p><p><strong>Nunca trabajo los domingos.</strong></p><p>Em português: Nunca trabalho aos domingos.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/b73bd2ed01da4df6b42341c376591961_nunca-trabajo-los-domingos.mp3?Expires=1794099447&Signature=ohL3ex9k8yNwqb3nag1YOmGtvb3tiGljfqqKARrQSDAOv~9M6AiX81WqLisWrur2ppOH3f6IGTbY0JFk8wKTkGn2RmQH3ucwL7bXhODXrrQBIkpySal6wV6KoVxSahs0HDhtLxoDQfFCumbKsEu4Q8oWrU-tIr0KJQMDa~iiDsTpCxdsnKVedse-v~USefWJUeLy4peUZ3lCBG3h4yXRwq3~4m1i1phvCsh9KeuU3FyInZi-ZqIpz8D0OFa7GrrxCTa6NhdlK7Mru8TncUqo7VWVtV0VvC3t-gjCOYs7h0evtAA8KbqmqW73DaSR3rWuFG6byUaXgna1rdR22Z9P1w__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
